# Copy this file to .env, then paste the Mistral key straight after the = sign, no quotes.
# Judges: use your own key from https://console.mistral.ai (API Keys). Team: ask Shahil in a
# private message. Never commit .env or paste the key into
# GitHub, an issue, a PR or a group chat. Keep this comment as the first line: on Windows,
# Notepad can add an invisible mark at the very start of the file that hides the key line.
MISTRAL_API_KEY=
